Third-party attribution
=======================

principles/slop-patterns.md and scripts/strip-invisibles.py are adapted from
DeSlop, an AI prose sanitizer for VS Code:

    https://github.com/AUAggy/deslop

slop-patterns.md adapts the pattern catalogue from DeSlop's
src/prompts/system.ts and src/prompts/modifiers.ts, reorganized to lead with
the false-positive and false-negative guards, and recalibrated on punctuation.
strip-invisibles.py ports the character classes and protected-region handling
from DeSlop's src/util/postCheck.ts.

